Below are the Blood Rites available to all Blood Hunters. If a
Rite has a prerequisite Blood Hunter level you can learn that
Rite at the same time you meet its prerequisite level.
Whenever you learn a new Blood Rite you can choose one
Blood Rite you know and replace it with another Blood Rite
of your choice for which you meet the prerequisites.

Empowered Rites. Some Blood Rites can be empowered
for additional potency. To gain these empowered effects, you
make a Vital Sacrifice as part of invoking the Blood Rite.

